  s10: Clear discarded the queue#59; a turn is launching
  s11: Create answered#59; first input not submitted
  s12: First input submitted#59; receipt not committed
  s13: Clear began: epoch bumped#59; a finished launch never released its registration
  s14: Clear discarded the queue#59; a finished launch never released its registration
  s15: Receipt committed#59; source not bound
  s16: One new Ready session#59; inputs await the owner
  s17: One new Ready session#59; inputs settled once
  s18: Clear began: epoch bumped#59; a new session lives
  s19: Clear discarded the queue#59; a new session lives
